This repository does not ship third-party datasets. The tool in
tools/domotica-data downloads the following datasets, converts them and uses
them to train the smart-home models described in docs/domotica.md. Data and
models derived from them must carry these attributions (CC BY 4.0, section
3(a)). Changes made: only the es/en portions are used; intents are relabeled to
the demo-room taxonomy; slots are trimmed and normalized; Home Assistant
templates are expanded into sentences with the demo room's areas and devices.
Details: docs/domotica-datos.md.

